;; One eww daemon for the right-edge gauges (volume, brightness).
;; Widgets live in widgets/*.yuck; scripts/edge-ctl opens and closes them.
;;
;; The daemon is started at login (`eww daemon`, see hypr autostart) and
;; reloaded by rice-theme after a theme switch. No window is mapped while the
;; gauges are idle.
(include "widgets/edge.yuck")
